WEBVTT

00:04:28.556 --> 00:04:32.116
But I managed to persuade
those around me that I was fabulous.

00:04:33.596 --> 00:04:36.956
The first time I performed
in drag, I was 19,

00:04:36.996 --> 00:04:38.876
and to put it lightly,

00:04:38.916 --> 00:04:40.916
I was not fabulous.

00:04:40.916 --> 00:04:42.476
But so was everyone.

00:04:42.516 --> 00:04:45.876
And the standard back then, in 2011,
was much lower than it is now.

00:04:46.356 --> 00:04:49.516
And, you know, the people of my repressed
generation

00:04:49.556 --> 00:04:52.116
were just pretty happy
to see something different.

00:04:53.476 --> 00:04:54.836
But ...

00:04:54.876 --> 00:04:56.676
As bad as I might have been,

00:04:56.716 --> 00:05:00.556
this experience
was such a liberatory process,